{{#isBasicBearer}}`Authorization: Bearer <token>`, an HTTP bearer token. Send a Flow token, such as a `bfk_` key token. Behind an authenticating proxy, Flow also accepts the proxy's JSON Web Token (JWT) here, which is the format the contract names{{#bearerFormat}}: `{{{.}}}`{{/bearerFormat}}.
{{/isBasicBearer}}
{{#isApiKey}}{{#isKeyInHeader}}`{{keyParamName}}: <token>`, an HTTP header. Send a Flow token here instead of in `Authorization`.
{{/isKeyInHeader}}{{#isKeyInQuery}}`?{{keyParamName}}=<token>`, a URL query parameter. {{{description}}} Only the routes whose **Authorization** section lists `{{name}}` accept it: `POST /api/v2/webhook`, `POST /api/v2/event`, and `GET` or `POST /api/v2/callback`.

